{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:22.40]Lost in a dark place, lost in a dark place\n[00:56.34]Lost in a dark place\n[Verse]\n[01:25.08]Lost in a dark place, trapped in the crawlspace\n[03:02.06]In my mind, I get lost, then I wake up in a coffin\n[05:05.80]They tell me they care, they're just in love with the music\n[07:32.72]So they'll never know about the pain I go through\n[08:18.88]It's like a chain of reactions, all these demon attacks\n[08:24.00]From all the drugs that I'm taking to the women distracting me\n[08:29.82]From being myself, it's like I'm losing my traction\n[08:35.06]Kiss death on the lips, I have a fatal attraction\n[08:40.66]This is my heart, watch as my problems inspire me\n[08:45.82]Tear me apart, won't let the demons take over me\n[08:50.76]They took it too far, now I need some surgery\n[08:56.04]I'm falling apart\n[08:58.32]It's like I'm lost in the motions, use this song as a rope\n[09:05.76]To wrap around the commotion, tie the knot at my throat\n[09:11.18]I look at death as a notion, I don't want it no more\n[09:16.24]But it's too late to reverse it, as I fall on the floor\n[Outro]\n[09:22.36]Lost in a dark place, lost in a dark place\n[10:30.48]Demons inspire me\n[10:53.70]Ooh, oh","words":[[22.4,22.74,"Lost"],[25.5,25.6,"in"],[30.42,30.42,"a"],[34.54,34.84,"dark"],[42.6,43.4,"place,"],[45.58,45.9,"lost"],[46.36,46.56,"in"],[47.0,47.0,"a"],[48.9,49.22,"dark"],[55.66,55.98,"place"],[56.34,56.72,"Lost"],[56.76,56.84,"in"],[61.02,61.02,"a"],[74.6,74.94,"dark"],[84.3,84.78,"place"],[85.08,85.42,"Lost"],[86.8,86.9,"in"],[88.12,88.12,"a"],[90.62,90.9,"dark"],[94.8,95.28,"place,"],[101.04,102.72,"trapped"],[120.7,120.82,"in"],[164.36,164.48,"the"],[176.38,177.14,"crawlspace"],[182.06,182.22,"In"],[182.3,182.66,"my"],[194.68,195.34,"mind,"],[198.3,198.3,"I"],[198.34,198.44,"get"],[198.54,199.28,"lost,"],[205.12,205.52,"then"],[206.52,206.52,"I"],[206.78,207.8,"wake"],[216.34,216.46,"up"],[220.42,220.8,"in"],[225.44,225.44,"a"],[303.8,305.14,"coffin"],[305.